//! The `empty-cells` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets whether
//! borders and backgrounds appear around `table` cells that have no visible content.
//!
//! Initial: show. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - hide: No borders or backgrounds are drawn.
//! - show: Borders and backgrounds are drawn like in normal cells.
